    "chunk_text": "9. The seal of the Corporation shall not be affixed to anyinstrument whatsoever except in the presence of the presidentand such number of persons as may be provided for in therules of the corporation, who shall sign their names to theinstrument in token of their presence, and such signing shallbe independent of the signing of any person as a witness.\n\n11. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nCorporation mayhold movable orimmovableproperty.\n\nSeal of theCorporation.\n\nSavings of therights of theRepublic andothers.\n\nSinhala text toprevail in case ofinconsistency.\n\nSareeram Sri Lanka National Foundation(Incorporation) Act, No. 1 of 19995\n\nSCHEDULE[Section 5(2)]\n\nPresidentMr. A. Logeswaran\n\nVice Presidents :Mr. A. SivalingamMrs. L. AnanthyMr. M. Kasipillai\n\nGeneral Secretary :Mr. K. Vanniyasingam\n\nAdditional Secretaries : Mr. A. KrisnamoorthyMr. M. PusparajMr. M. Suntharalingam\n\nTreasurer :Mr. K. Vellaisamy\n\nExecutive Members :Mr. S.K. PonnampalamMr. V. JesudasanMr. T.BaptistMr. K. LinkarajMiss T. ShiyamalaMr. T. SittampalamMiss N. NishiyanthyMiss M. Dilani\n\nAdvisery :Mr. K. ThangarajahMr. R. ThurairajasingamMr. G. Radhakrishnam\n\nAnnual subscription of English Bills and Acts of the Parliament Rs. 885 (Local), Rs. 1,180(Foreign).payable to the SUPERINTENDENT, GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, No. 32,TRANSWORKS HOUSE,LOTUS ROAD, COLOMBO 01 before 15th December each year in respect of the year following."
