    "chunk_text": "6Pasyodunrata Development Foundation(Incorporation) Act, No.5 of 1999\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPASYODUNRATA DEVELOPMENTFOUNDATION (INCORPORATION)ACT, No. 05 OF 1999\n\n[Certified on 26th March, 1999]\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of March 26, 1999.\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.TO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 01\n\nPrice: Rs. 4.50 Postage: Rs.3.50\n\n(Internet Version)\n\n1Pasyodunrata Development Foundation(Incorporation) Act, No.5 of 1999\n\n[Certified on 26th March , 1999]L.D. - O 30/97.\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE PASYODUNRATA DEVELOPMENTFOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS a foundation called and known as the\u201cPasyodunrata Development Foundation\u201d has heretofore beenformed at Matugama for the purpose of effectively carryingout the objects of the said Foundation and transacting allmatters connected with the said Foundation according to therules agreed to by its members;\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out transacted the several objects andmatters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantthe application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1.This act may be cited as the PasyodunrataDevelopment Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No.5 of 1999."
