    "chunk_text": "PALAKA SABHAWA OF BERUWALAMALEWANA SRI GNANISSARA AYURVEDICMEDICAL COLLEGE (INCORPORATION)ACT, No. 15 OF 1999\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n[Certified on 15 th June, 1999]\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of June 18, 1999.\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 1\n\nPrice : Rs. 4.50Postage : Rs. 3.50\n\n(Internet Version)\n\n1Palaka Sabhawa of Beruwala MalewanaSri Gnanissara Ayurvedic Medical College(Incorporation) Act No. 15 of 1999\n\n[Certified on 15 th June, 1999]\n\nL.D.\u2013O.80/95.\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE PALAKA SABHAWA OF BERUWALAMALEWANA SRI GNANISSARA AYURVEDIC MEDICAL COLLEGE\n\nWHEREAS a college called and known as the \u201c BeruwalaMalewana Sri Gnanissara Ayurvedic Medical College\u201d hasheretofore been established in Sri Lanka for the purpose ofeffectually carrying out and transacting all the objects andmatters connected with the said College according to the rulesagreed to by its members ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the affairs and objects of the said Collegehave heretofore been managed and carried out by a PalakaSabawa;\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Palaka Sabawa has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantthe application ;\n\nBE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Palaka Sabhawa ofBeruwala Malewana Sri Gnanissara Ayurvedic Medical College(Incorporation) Act, No.15 of 1999."
  },
