    "chunk_text": "6Council of the College of Community Physiciansof Sri Lanka (Incorporation) Act, No.18 of 1999\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nCOUNCIL OF THE COLLEGE OF COMMUNITYPHYSICIANS OF SRI LANKA (INCORPORATION)ACT, NO. 18 oF 1999\n\n[Certified on 24th June, 1999]\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of June 25, 1999\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.TO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 01\n\nPrice: 4.50Postage: Rs. 3.50\n\n[Internet Version]\n\n1Council of the College of Community Physiciansof Sri Lanka (Incorporation) Act, No.18 of 1999\n\n[Certified on 24 th June, 1999]\n\nL.D. - O. 61/96.\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE COUNCIL OF THE COLLEGE OFCOMMUNITY PHYSICIANS OF SRI LANKA\n\nWHEREAS a College called and Known as \u201c The Collegeof Community Physicians of Sri Lanka\u201d has heretofore beenestablished in Sri Lanka;\n\nAND WHEREAS the affairs and objects of the saidCollege have heretofore been successfully managed andcarried out by the council of the College.\n\nAND WHEREAS the council of the college has applied tobe incorporated and will be for the public advantage to grantthe application.\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1.This Act may be cited as The Council of the Collegeof Community Physicians of Sri Lanka (Incorporation) Act,No. 18 of 1999."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_acts",
    "doc_id": "1999-06-24-1999-06-24-18-1999-en",
