    "chunk_text": "(b) the re-imbursement or repayment of reasonable andproper expenses incurred, with the prior written approvalof the Committee of Management, by any member, officeror servant of the Corporation, in the discharge orperformance of his functions or duties or in promotingthe objects of the Corporation.\n\n10. It shall be lawful for the Corporation\u2013\n\n(b) to invest any funds not immediately required for thepurposes of the Corporation, in such manner as theCommittee of Management may think fit from time totime and to vary and transfer any such investments ;\n\n(c) to secure the discharge of any debt, or obligation of theCorporation in such manner as it may think fit ;\n\nPropertyremaining ondissolution.\n\nMarkez Islamic Centre (Incorporation)Act, No. 19 of 19995\n\n(d) to receive subscriptions, grants, donations and gifts ofall kinds, locally and from aborad, for the purposes ofthe Corporation ;\n\n(e) to construct, alter or maintain, any buildings requiredfor the purposes of the Corporation ;\n\n(f) to appoint, dismiss or terminate officers and servants ofthe Corporation, and to pay them such salaries,pensions, gratuities and allowances as may from time totime be determined by the Committee of Management ;\n\n(g) to establish or contribute to any fund or scheme for thegrant of gratuities, pensions, allowances or other benefitsto officers or servants, past or present, of the Corporationor to the relatives or dependants of such officers andservants ;\n\n(h) to enter into any contract with any person, company,society or body of persons, whether corporate orunincorporate, for promoting the objects of theCorporation ;\n\n(i) to give grants, endowments or scholarships for thepurposes of the Corporation ; and\n\n(j) subject to the provisions of any other written law to doall other things necessary or expedient for the properand effective carrying out of the objects of theCorporation."
