    "chunk_text": "MAHANUWARA BAUDDHA VIDYA PEETAYA(INCORPORATION)ACT, No. 23 OF 1999\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n[Certified on 12th August, 1999]\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of August 13, 1999.\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 01\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.75Postage : Rs. 3.50\n\n(Internet Version)\n\n1Mahanuwara Bauddha Vidya Peetaya(Incorporation) Act, No. 23 of 1999\n\n[Certified on 12 th August, 1999]\n\nL.D.\u2013O. 48/96.\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE MAHANUWARA BAUDDHAVIDYA PEETAYA\n\nWHEREAS a centre called and known as the \u201cMahanuwaraBauddha Vidya Peetaya\u201d has heretofore been established atGurudeniya, Tennakumbura, Kandy for the purpose ofeffectively carrying out and transacting all matters connectedwith the said Centre, according to the rules agreed to, by itsmembers:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Centre has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied to beincorporated, and it is now desirable and expedient that thesaid Centre should be incorporated:\n\nBE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :-\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Mahanuwara BauddhaVidya Peetaya (Incorporation) Act, No.23 of 1999."
  },
