    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :-\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Mahanuwara BauddhaVidya Peetaya (Incorporation) Act, No.23 of 1999.\n\n3. The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be-\n\n(a) to foster and promote education by establishing andmaintaining \u201cMahanuwara Bauddha Vidya Peetaya\u201d,Pirivena training institutes of bhikkus, schools, andEducational institutions and by granting scholarships;\n\nGeneral objectsof theCorporation\n\nShort title.\n\nIncorporation ofthe MahanuwaraBauddha VidyaPeetaya.\n\nH - 022545\n\nPreamble.\n\n2Mahanuwara Bauddha Vidya Peetaya(Incorporation) Act, No. 23 of 1999\n\n(b) to preserve and disseminate the Theravadhi Buddhistphilosophy and way of life;\n\n(c) to maintain friendly relations with other Buddhistorganisations in and outside Sri Lanka;\n\n(d) to establish and maintain a department for orientallanguages;\n\n(e) to establish and maintain a department forinternational languages such as English, French;\n\n(f) to engage in the dissemination of the Dhammainternationally;\n\n(g) to conduct vocational and educational courses foryouths in Sri Lanka;\n\n(h) to train students in small industries and to help themfinancially or otherwise to establish themselves asuseful citizens;\n\n(i) to engage in any industry, trade or import and exportbusiness and to promote and carry on anyagricultural, industrial and commercial enterprise, toprovide aid and assistance to any person for suchenterprises, to conduct training programmes and toorganize services and propaganda campaigns, witha view to providing the public with technologicalexpertise;\n\n(j) to give aid by way of scholarships, or cash orotherwise, to monks, volunteers and other persons,engaged in the furtherance of the objects of theCorporation;"
  },
