    "chunk_text": "4. Subject to the provisions of this Act, and other writtenlaw, the Corporation shall have the power to do, perform executeall such acts, matters and things whatsoever, as are necessaryor desirable for the promotion and furtherance of the objectsof the Corporation or any one of them, including the power toopen, operate and close bank accounts, to borrow or raisemoneys, with or without security, to receive or collect grantsand donations, to invest its funds, and to engage employ anddismiss officers and servants for the purpose of carrying outof the objects of the Corporation.\n\nGeneral Powers ofthe Corporation.\n\nManagement ofthe affairs of theCorporation.\n\n4Mahanuwara Bauddha Vidya Peetaya(Incorporation) Act, No. 23 of 1999\n\n(2) Notwithstanding anything to the contrary in subsection(1) of this section the Venerable Theripehe Sri DhammanandaThero, shall be the Director-General of the Corporation forlife and he shall nominate his successor to be Director-Generalof the Corporation after him. Such succeeding Director-General shall also hold the office of Director-General for life.\n\n(3) The first Board of Directors of the Corporation shallconsist of the members of the Committee of Management ofthe Bauddha Vidya Peetaya holding office on the daypreceding the date of commencement of this Act, and whosenames are specified in the First Schedule to this Act."
