    "chunk_text": "6Periya Moulana, Zain Moulana Shrines andThakiyas Development Society (Incorporation)Act, No. 26 of 1999\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPERIYA MOULANA, ZAIN MOULANASHRINES AND THAKIYAS DEVELOPMENTSOCIETY (INCORPORATION)ACT, NO.26 OF 1999\n\n[Certified on 30th August, 1999]\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of September 03, 1999.\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.TO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 01\n\nPrice: Rs.4.50Postage: Rs.3.50\n\n(Internet Version)\n\n1Periya Moulana, Zain Moulana Shrines andThakiyas Development Society (Incorporation)Act, No. 26 of 1999\n\n[Certified on 30 th August , 1999]L.D.- O. 58/96.\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE PERIYA MOULANA, ZAINMOULANA SHRINES AND THAKIYAS DEVELOPMENT SOCIETY\n\nWHEREAS a Development Society called and Known asthe \u201cPeriya Moulana, Zain Moulana Shrines and ThakiyasDevelopment Society heretofore been formed for thepurpose of effectually carrying out and transacting all objectsand matters connected with the said Development Societyaccording to the rules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Development Society hasheretofore successfully carried out and transacted theseveral objects for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantthe application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Periya Moulana, ZainMoulana Shrines and Thakiyas Development Society(Incorporation) Act, No.26 of 1999."
  },
