    "chunk_text": "(e) to establish and maintain a Muslim religious schoolfor the teaching of Quran and the Arabic Language;and\n\n(f) do such other acts and things as are conducive orincidental to the attainment of all or any of the aboveobjects.\n\nGeneral objectsof theCorporation.\n\nGeneral powersof theCorporation.\n\n3Periya Moulana, Zain Moulana Shrines andThakiyas Development Society (Incorporation)Act, No. 26 of 1999\n\n5. (1) The affairs of the Corporation shall subject to therules in force for the time being of the Corporation, beadministered by a Board of Trustees elected in accordancewith such rules.\n\n(2) The first Board of Trustees of the Corporation shallbe the Board of Trustees of the Development Society holdingoffice on the day preceding the date of commencement of thisAct and whose names are specified in the Schedule to thisAct.\n\n6.(1) It shall be lawful for the Corporation, from time totime, at any general meeting and by a majority of the members who are the descendants of the Seyed Zain SakhaffMoulana family present and voting, to make rules not incon-sistent with the provisions of this act and any other writtenlaw, for the admission , withdrawal and expulsion of membersof the Corporation, for the election of the office-bearers andthe Board of Trustees and their powers conduct and duties,for the procedure to be followed at the meetings of theCorporation and the Board of Trustees and generally, for themanagement of the affairs of the Corporation and theaccomplishment of its objects. Such rules when made may, ata like meeting and in like manner be altered, added to, amendedor rescinded.\n\n(2) The members of the Corporation shall be subject tothe rules of the Corporation."
  },
