    "chunk_text": "10Code of Criminal Procedure (Amendment)Act, No. 47 of 1999\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nCODE OF CRIMINAL PROCEDURE(AMENDMENT) ACT , No. 47 OF 1999\n\n[Certified on 10th December, 1999]\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of December 10, 1999\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.TO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 01\n\nPrice: Rs. 6. 75Postage: Rs.3.50\n\n[Internet Version]\n\n1Code of Criminal Procedure (Amendment)Act, No. 47 of 1999\n\nH-022545\n\n[Certified on 10th December , 1999]\n\nL. D. - O. 33/99.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE CODE OF CRIMINAL PROCEDUREACT, NO. 15 OF 1979\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :-\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Code of CriminalProcedure (Amendment) Act, No.47 of 1999 and shall comeinto operation on such date as the Minister may appoint byOrder published in the Gazette.\n\n2. Section 303 and 304 of the Code of CriminalProcedure Act, No.15 of 1979 (hereinafter referred to as \u201c theprincipal enactment\u201d) are hereby repealed and the followingsections substituted therefor :-\n\n303. (1) Subject to the provisions of thissection, on sentencing an offender to a term ofimprisonment, a court may make an ordersuspending the whole or part of the sentence ifit is satisfied, for reasons to be stated in writing,that it is appropriate to do so in thecircumstances, haveing regard to \u2013\n\n(a) the maximum penalty prescirbed for theoffence in respect of which the sentenceis imposed ;\n\n(b) the nature and gravity of the offence ;\n\n(c) the offender\u2019s culpability and degree ofresponsibility for the offence ;\n\n(d) the offender\u2019s previous character ;\n\n(e) any injury, loss or damage resultingdirectly from the commission of theoffence ;\n\nShort title anddate of operation.\n\nReplacement ofsections 303 and304 of Act,No.15of 1979.\n\n\u201cSuspendedsentence ofimprisonment"
