    "chunk_text": "PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 1\n\nPrice : Rs. 7.00 Postage : Rs. 4.50\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka of March 27 , 2002\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 25th March, 2002]\n\nCOMPETENT AUTHORITY(POWERS AND FUNCTIONS) ACT, No. 3 OF 2002\n\nCompetent Authority (Powers and Functions)Act, No. 3 of 20021\n\n2\u2014H 013391\u20145,550 (2002/02)\n\n[Certified on 25th March , 2002]\n\nL.D\u2014O. 5/2002.\n\nAN ACT TO PROVIDE FOR THE POWERS AND FUNCTIONS OF THECOMPETENT AUTHORITY APPOINTED BY THE ELECTIONCOMMISSION UNDER THE CONSTITUTION ; AND TO PROVIDE FOR\n\nMATTERS CONNECTED THEREWITH OR INCIDENTAL THERETO\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Competent Authority(Powers and Functions) Act, No. 3 of 2002.\n\n2.The Competent Authority appointed under sub-paragraph (c) of paragraph (5) of Article 104B of theConstitution (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cCompetentAuthority\u201d) to take over the management of the Sri LankaBroadcasting Corporation or the Sri Lanka RupavahiniCorporation, as the case may be, shall exercise and dischargethe following powers and functions :\u2014\n\n(a) carry on the radio or television broadcasting services,as the case may be, while maintaining in the publicinterest and in the conduct of a free and fair electionor referendum, high standards in programming ;\n\n(b) register persons engaged in the production oftelevision or radio programmes relating to an electionor a referendum, as the case may be, whichprogrammes are intended to be broadcast ;\n\n(c) exercise supervision and control over programmesbroadcast by the Sri Lanka Broadcasting Corporationor the Sri Lanka Rupavahini Corporation, as the casemay be, relating to an election or a referendum ;"
  },
