03, for a period upto thirty six\n\n2\u2014H 017469\u2014 6,650 (12/2002)\n\nShort title.\n\nAmendment ofsection 2 of ActNo. 14 of 2002.\n\nValue Added Tax (Amendment) Act, No. 7 of 20032"
