ncies.\u201d.\n\n2National Institute of Plantation Management(Amendment) Act, No. 38 of 2003\n\n3. Section 6 of the principal enactment as amended byAct, No. 76 of 1981 and Act, No. 5 of 1987 is hereby furtheramended as follows :\u2014"
