    "chunk_text": "PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 1\n\nPrice : Rs. 4.25 Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of February 11, 2005\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Certified on 10th February, 2005]\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nSRI LANKA RAILWAYS AUTHORITY(REPEAL) ACT, No. 3 OF 2005\n\nSri Lanka Railways Authority (Repeal)Act, No. 3 of 20051\n\nShort title.\n\n2 \u2013 H 22936\u2013 5,650 (11/2004)\n\n[Certified on 10th February, 2005]\n\nL. D. \u2014O. 25/2004.\n\nAN ACT TO REPEAL THE SRI LANKA RAILWAYS AUTHORITY ACT, NO. 60\n\nOF 1993; AND TO PROVIDE FOR MATTERS CONNECTED THEREWITH OR\n\nINCIDENTAL THERTO\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sri Lanka RailwaysAuthority (Repeal) Act, No. 3 of 2005.\n\n2.The Sri Lanka Railways Authority Act, No. 60 of 1993,is hereby repealed.\n\n3.(1) Notwithstanding the repeal of the Sri LankaRailways Authority Act, No. 60 of 1993 by section 2, allmoneys lying, on the date of commencement of this Act, tothe credit of the Sri Lanka Railways Authority established bythe Sri Lanka Railways Authority Act, No. 60 of 1993 shall,with effect from such date, stand transferred to theConsolidated Fund.\n\n(2) (a) All proceedings instituted in any court or tribunalby or against the Sri Lanka Railways Authority establishedunder the repealed Act and pending on the day preceding thedate of commencement of this Act, shall be deemed, witheffect from the date of commencement of this Act, to beproceedings instituted by or against the Railways Departmentand be proceeded with accordingly."
